          "topicChoiceBoundary": "Required own foundation for an already authored target under the owner policy including authored topics before a later selector; no individual learner choice or new universal official duty is asserted.",
          "sourceLimit": "RP9.1 supports the coordinate-bonding core at LK. The whole existing Fehling/tartrate and supplied qualitative occupied-donor/unoccupied-acceptor orbital case is a declared own operational foundation, not exact official whole-profile credit. No choice of9.2/8.7 or full optional orbital/complex theory module is inferred.",
